{{High Risk|Template:Nbsp|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Inserts a single non-breaking space (<code>&amp;nbsp;</code>). Use it to keep two items together on one line — a number and its unit, a name and an honorific, initials — so they never split across a line break. Takes no parameters; each call produces exactly one non-breaking space.

==Syntax==
{{T|Nbsp}}

==Examples==
{| class="dataTable"
! Code !! Result
|-
| <code><nowiki>100{{Nbsp}}m</nowiki></code> || 100{{Nbsp}}m
|-
| <code><nowiki>Vol.{{Nbsp}}3</nowiki></code> || Vol.{{Nbsp}}3
|}